{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Little Worm for Your Desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your <strong>own tiny desktop worm pet</strong>. It <strong>moves when you type, click, or play with a gamepad</strong>. Every input makes it crawl a bit further until it reaches the screen edge and <strong>turns around</strong>. It is small, calm, and just hangs out with you while you use your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/f3791d8e45227fa393a13632548bdb95.poster.avif?t=1774477979\" width=596 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/f3791d8e45227fa393a13632548bdb95.webm?t=1774477979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/f3791d8e45227fa393a13632548bdb95.mp4?t=1774477979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pocket Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want less movement, put it in Pocket Mode. The worm sits in a <strong>small pocket on your screen</strong> and its <strong>head follows your mouse cursor</strong>. It stays close, quietly judging your life choices while you work and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/e5308de6b99368d36a531422497fc85e.poster.avif?t=1774477979\" width=596 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/e5308de6b99368d36a531422497fc85e.webm?t=1774477979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/e5308de6b99368d36a531422497fc85e.mp4?t=1774477979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items &amp; Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you use your PC, you <strong>earn points </strong>by typing and clicking. Spend those points on <strong>item drops</strong> to unlock <strong>new hats and skins</strong>. Make your worm <strong>cute, silly, stylish, or totally cursed</strong> \u2013 it is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/7027301977c5ca2fa5736f316b156157.poster.avif?t=1774477979\" width=596 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/7027301977c5ca2fa5736f316b156157.webm?t=1774477979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/7027301977c5ca2fa5736f316b156157.mp4?t=1774477979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Common (85%),\u00a0Uncommon (10%), Rare (4%), Epic (0.95%), Legendary (0.05%)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Upgrading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have <strong>duplicate items</strong> or styles you do not use?\u00a0<strong>Combine items </strong>of the same rarity to craft one from the next tier. You can also <strong>feed items to your worm</strong> to add more body segments, so it slowly <strong>grows</strong> longer over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/8a103317f9fa85030e670f86c9275adc.poster.avif?t=1774477979\" width=596 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/8a103317f9fa85030e670f86c9275adc.webm?t=1774477979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/8a103317f9fa85030e670f86c9275adc.mp4?t=1774477979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Comfort Settings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>scale the worm</strong> to be <strong>tiny or big</strong>, just how you like it. Resize the pocket, and adjust <strong>many settings\u00a0</strong>to make your companion feel cozy on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/d44e20205ded513a3569243c3bec995e.poster.avif?t=1774477979\" width=596 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/d44e20205ded513a3569243c3bec995e.webm?t=1774477979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/extras/d44e20205ded513a3569243c3bec995e.mp4?t=1774477979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made for Focus &amp; Breaks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Pomodoro timer</strong> to <strong>work in gentle focus blocks</strong> with clear breaks. Turn on the <strong>Anti-Shrimp stretch reminder</strong> so the worm can remind you to sit up straight, stand up, and stretch. It is a <strong>small, friendly nudge</strong> to take better care of yourself while you are at your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Click 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044170/4dab22f2f15601b7ac9da4b5dc658b242f1e5a14.jpg"},{"name":"Clicks 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044170/4dab22f2f15601b7ac9da4b5dc658b242f1e5a14.jpg"},{"name":"Clicks 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044170/4dab22f2f15601b7ac9da4b5dc658b242f1e5a14.jpg"},{"name":"Clicks 10.000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044170/4dab22f2f15601b7ac9da4b5dc658b242f1e5a14.jpg"},{"name":"Clicks 100.000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044170/4dab22f2f15601b7ac9da4b5dc658b242f1e5a14.jpg"},{"name":"Clicks 1.000.000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044170/4dab22f2f15601b7ac9da4b5dc658b242f1e5a14.jpg"},{"name":"Clicks 1.000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044170/4dab22f2f15601b7ac9da4b5dc658b242f1e5a14.jpg"},{"name":"First Upgrade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044170/8b2f58283dae14c6b2d3d70f9074b6c2866564c1.jpg"},{"name":"Mentor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044170/bb4f07ae03cc4e346db1d89afd60543e989cf985.jpg"},{"name":"Crafting Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044170/aed0787fefb9b50109a8a5a169dbd05cd0c26d09.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044170?t=1774477979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/7cbd75f532c7eb5ec51d53e8fc6e599d2a477eca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774477979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/54b3b2dd2778142b6c4cbcf7e552f85a287be03a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774477979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044170/54b3b2dd2778142b6c4cbcf7e552f85a2